Source: kencoder
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Pitriss <5106460+Pitriss@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, qt6-base-dev, qt6-declarative-dev, extra-cmake-modules, libkf6kcmutils-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/Pitriss/kencoder
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/Pitriss/kencoder
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/Pitriss/kencoder.git

Package: kencoder
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: encoder (>= @MIN_ENCODER_VERSION@), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, qt6-qpa-plugins, libkf6kcmutils6, qml6-module-org-kde-kcmutils, qml6-module-org-kde-kirigami
Description: Qt6 GUI for HP OMEN Encoder lighting
 KDE Plasma 6 friendly lighting controls for the HP OMEN Encoder keyboard.
